{"id":636,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"Larvesta’s body is warm all over. It spouts fire from the tips of its horns to intimidate predators and scare prey."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"The people of ancient times believed that Larvesta fell from the sun."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"It protects itself with flame. Long years ago, people believed Larvesta had a nest on the sun."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"When battling opponents, it sprays fire from its five horns. The max temperature of the flames can reach nearly 5,500 degrees Fahrenheit."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Y","White"],"text":"The base of volcanoes is where they make their homes. They shoot fire from their five horns to repel attacking enemies."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","X","White 2","Black 2"],"text":"Said to have been born from the sun, it spews fire from its horns and encases itself in a cocoon of fire when it evolves."},{"games":["Black"],"text":"This Pokémon was believed to have been born from the sun. When it evolves, its entire body is engulfed in flames."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Flame Body","hidden":false,"description":"Contact with the Pokémon may burn the attacker."},{"name":"Swarm","hidden":true,"description":"Powers up Bug-type moves when the Pokémon's HP is low."}],"eggGroups":["Bug"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":40,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"slow","habitat":null,"color":"White","shape":"Armor","evolution":{"id":636,"name":"Larvesta","condition":null,"children":[{"id":637,"name":"Volcarona","condition":"Lv. 59","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,52],[1,81],[6,488],[12,522],[18,172],[24,450],[30,103],[36,141],[42,405],[48,36],[54,133],[60,38],[66,394]],"machine":[512,133,34,450,405,347,38,203,263,126,83,488,53,394,202,257,141,113,679,315,884,182,94,156,806,214,76,522,164,241,36,851,885,369,528,261,428],"egg":[71,106,234,37],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"zsv10pt5-99","name":"Larvesta","set":"Black Bolt","date":"2025-07-18","rarity":"Illustratio